{
  "format": "srwb",
  "format_version": "1.0",
  "exported_at": "2026-08-15T06:58:38.077Z",
  "notebook": {
    "id": "default",
    "name": "Muestrario de ggplot2",
    "autoNameNumber": null,
    "description": "",
    "kernelLanguage": "r",
    "catalogId": null,
    "catalogRevision": null,
    "cellCounter": 13,
    "cells": [
      {
        "id": 1,
        "code": "# Muestrario de ggplot2\n\nGráficos interactivos de ggplot2 con el tema oscuro de SciREPL —aplicado automáticamente, sin configuración previa.\n\nUtiliza conjuntos de datos integrados de R (`mpg`, `mtcars`). No requiere descarga de datos.",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 2,
        "code": "install.packages(\"ggplot2\")\nlibrary(ggplot2)\ncat(\"ggplot2 cargado — theme_scirepl() aplicado automáticamente\\n\")",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "r",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "ggplot2 cargado — theme_scirepl() aplicado automáticamente",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">ggplot2 cargado — theme_scirepl() aplicado automáticamente</pre>"
      },
      {
        "id": 3,
        "code": "## 1. Gráfico de dispersión con línea de tendencia",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 4,
        "code": "ggplot(mpg, aes(displ, hwy, color = class)) +\n  geom_point(size = 2, alpha = 0.7) +\n  geom_smooth(method = \"lm\", se = FALSE, color = \"#58a6ff\") +\n  labs(title = \"Tamaño del motor vs. MPG en carretera\",\n       x = \"Cilindrada (L)\", y = \"MPG en carretera\")",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "r",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "`geom_smooth()` using formula = 'y ~ x'",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<pre class=\"text-result\" dir=\"ltr\">`geom_smooth()` using formula = 'y ~ x'</pre><img src=\"blob:http://localhost:8090/ed485824-786b-42b5-b088-641b1a2e5ad4\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; margin-top: 8px;\">"
      },
      {
        "id": 5,
        "code": "## 2. Gráfico de barras facetado",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 6,
        "code": "ggplot(mpg, aes(class, fill = drv)) +\n  geom_bar(position = \"dodge\") +\n  facet_wrap(~year) +\n  labs(title = \"Clases de vehículos según el tipo de tracción (1999 vs. 2008)\",\n       x = \"Clase\", y = \"Cantidad\") +\n  theme(axis.text.x = element_text(angle = 45, hjust = 1))",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "r",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<img src=\"blob:http://localhost:8090/63a71dc8-38f1-4e63-87de-9926f35ee4c8\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; margin-top: 8px;\">"
      },
      {
        "id": 7,
        "code": "## 3. Gráfico de densidad",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 8,
        "code": "ggplot(mpg, aes(hwy, fill = drv)) +\n  geom_density(alpha = 0.5) +\n  labs(title = \"Distribución de MPG en carretera según el tipo de tracción\",\n       x = \"MPG en carretera\", y = \"Densidad\")",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "r",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<img src=\"blob:http://localhost:8090/e7105a21-1428-4498-a1b5-38f5955e6993\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; margin-top: 8px;\">"
      },
      {
        "id": 9,
        "code": "## 4. Diagrama de caja con dispersión de puntos (Jitter)",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 10,
        "code": "ggplot(mpg, aes(class, hwy, fill = class)) +\n  geom_boxplot(alpha = 0.7, show.legend = FALSE) +\n  geom_jitter(width = 0.2, alpha = 0.3, size = 1) +\n  labs(title = \"MPG en carretera por clase de vehículo\",\n       x = \"Clase\", y = \"MPG en carretera\") +\n  coord_flip()",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "r",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<img src=\"blob:http://localhost:8090/7717692a-9451-446f-893f-898e90a75ecb\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; margin-top: 8px;\">"
      },
      {
        "id": 11,
        "code": "## 5. Mapa de calor de correlaciones",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      },
      {
        "id": 12,
        "code": "corr <- round(cor(mtcars), 2)\nvars <- colnames(mtcars)\ngrid <- expand.grid(x = vars, y = vars)\ngrid$value <- as.vector(corr)\nggplot(grid, aes(x, y, fill = value)) +\n  geom_tile(color = \"#30363d\") +\n  geom_text(aes(label = ifelse(abs(value) > 0.5, value, \"\")),\n            color = \"#e6edf3\", size = 2.5) +\n  scale_fill_gradient2(low = \"#f85149\", mid = \"#161b22\", high = \"#58a6ff\",\n                       midpoint = 0, limits = c(-1, 1)) +\n  labs(title = \"Mapa de calor de correlaciones de mtcars\", fill = \"r\") +\n  theme(axis.text.x = element_text(angle = 45, hjust = 1))",
        "type": "code",
        "language": "r",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": "<img src=\"blob:http://localhost:8090/ab5823d5-587c-4d62-aff8-609cced59231\" style=\"max-width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; margin-top: 8px;\">"
      },
      {
        "id": 13,
        "code": "## Resumen\n\nTodos los gráficos anteriores utilizan `theme_scirepl()`, aplicado automáticamente cuando se carga ggplot2 en SciREPL.\n\nPersonaliza cualquier gráfico con las modificaciones estándar `+ theme(...)` de ggplot2.",
        "type": "markdown",
        "language": "markdown",
        "name": "",
        "lastOutput": "",
        "lastOutputHtml": ""
      }
    ]
  }
}